Subject: [PATCH 18/18] Add lynx-cssc host tool

Add a small host CLI that compiles ruleList JSON with Lynx's native CSS
profile and emits exactly one raw fragment payload. Allow the native renderer
test to consume the CLI output for end-to-end smoke coverage.
---
